00:31:25.840 --> 00:31:30.300
Another example of this is the
upcoming European Global Data

00:31:30.300 --> 00:31:33.300
Protection Regulation GDPR.

00:31:33.300 --> 00:31:36.030
And we are fully
committed to be complying

00:31:36.030 --> 00:31:42.940
