into effect May of 2018.

00:31:42.940 --> 00:31:45.820
We are constantly
innovating in our quest

00:31:45.820 --> 00:31:48.810
to find better ways to help
you secure your business.

00:31:48.810 --> 00:31:51.440
So today I'm going
to highlight two.

00:31:51.440 --> 00:31:55.510
The first one is
identity Aware Proxy.

00:31:55.510 --> 00:31:58.710
Remember how I said we
don't trust anything?

00:31:58.710 --> 00:32:04.640
One of the things we don't trust
is corporate networks and VPNs.

00:32:04.640 --> 00:32:08.750
Now traditional security
relies on VPN and firewalls.

00:32:08.750 --> 00:32:12.260
Now the problem with that,
if once a bad actor gets in,

00:32:12.260 --> 00:32:15.620
they can do a lot of damage.

00:32:15.620 --> 00:32:19.240
So instead, we offer
identity aware proxy

00:32:19.240 --> 00:32:22.570
