enforce who gets access

00:32:22.570 --> 00:32:26.020
to what at the
application layer,

00:32:26.020 --> 00:32:30.990
not with the remote
access VPNs and firewalls.

00:32:30.990 --> 00:32:33.420
The second one I want
to highlight today

00:32:33.420 --> 00:32:36.660
