00:43:42.760 --> 00:43:45.720
and the statistic 5%.

00:43:45.720 --> 00:43:47.430
So we did a lot of
internal research

00:43:47.430 --> 00:43:48.930
and external research a Google.

00:43:48.930 --> 00:43:51.180
User studies looked
because the modern office

00:43:51.180 --> 00:43:53.280
